{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>日本東北及北陸地區日本海沿岸，於上周五（20日）及上周六（21日）下大雪，多地交通受阻。福島縣北鹽原村昨（21日）公布，大雪令樹木倒塌，國道459號及部分縣道受阻，裏磐梯地區周邊514戶共948名居民，以及入住當地旅館等設施的至少約500名旅客陷入孤立狀態。</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-22T02:41:44.572144+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":129,"images":0,"source":"明報 國際","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-22T01:19:21+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-23T04:23:26.645215+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-22T02:35:16.797489+00:00","content_hash":"ac7b6ee4c6ce8705258c086b1e3a03d282c739fd03bb100633072e6fdd313098","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}